%H A038336 Bjorg N. Cyvin, Jon Brunvoll, and Sven J. Cyvin, <a href="https://match.pmf.kg.ac.rs/electronic_versions/Match34/match34_109-121.pdf">Isomer enumeration of unbranched catacondensed polygonal systems with pentagons and heptagons</a>, Match, No. 34 (Oct 1996), 109-121.
%H A038336 Bulat Khaidarov, <a href="https://cs.uwaterloo.ca/journals/JIS/VOL29/Khaidarov/khai3.html">Enumeration of Certain k-Block Partitions of Barry</a>, J. Int. Seq. 29 (2026), Art. 26.2.8. See p. 6 (Table 2).
%F A038336 G.f. as triangle: 1/(1-x*(10*y+12)). - _Robert Israel_, Apr 30 2019
%F A038336 T(n,k) = 10*T(n-1,k-1) + 12*T(n-1,k) with T(0,0)=1, T(n,k)=0 for k<0 or k>n. - _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Nov 01 2026
%e A038336 The triangle begins as:
%e A038336       1;
